   "notes": "Both the 7B and 67B base models are described; the block attributes use the 7B values (primary config). The 67B model uses GQA with 8 KV heads. The FFN width is given only as the formula $\\frac{8}{3}d_{model}$ (10922.67 for 7B), which is not an integer. The actual integer width is not stated, so d_ff is left not_stated. head_dim is not stated explicitly (it would be d_model/n_heads = 128 if derived). RoPE theta and pairing, norm eps, biases and embedding tying are not stated; they are left not_stated rather than inherited, because the LLaMA inheritance sentence is generic and LLaMA-1 and LLaMA-2 differ on some of these values. Final-norm placement follows the pre-norm convention and is not explicit."
